{title: Blessed Assurance}
{artist: Fanny Crosby / Phoebe Knapp}
{genre: Hymn, Gospel}
{style: Traditional}
{flow: Opening}
{key: D}
{tempo: 60}
{time: 9/8}
{hymnal: 새찬송가 288장}
{title_ko: 예수를 나의 구주 삼고}
{score: blessed-assurance.abc}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Blessed assurance, [G]Jesus is [D]mine!
O what a foretaste of [E7]glory di[A]vine!
[D]Heir of salvation, [G]purchase of [D]God
[G]Born of His [D]Spirit, [A]washed in His [D]blood
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]This is my story, [G]this is my [D]song
Praising my Savior [A]all the day long
[D]This is my story, [G]this is my [D]song
[G]Praising my [D]Savior [A]all the day [D]long
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]Perfect submission, [G]perfect de[D]light
Visions of rapture now [E7]burst on my [A]sight
[D]Angels descending [G]bring from a[D]bove
[G]Echoes of [D]mercy, [A]whispers of [D]love
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[D]Perfect submission, [G]all is at [D]rest
I in my Savior am [E7]happy and [A]blest
[D]Watching and waiting, [G]looking a[D]bove
[G]Filled with His [D]goodness, [A]lost in His [D]love
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
